{"Title":"An Act authorizing the city of New Bedford to grant a utility easement to the University of Massachusetts at Dartmouth","BillNumber":"H4962","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"H34","Name":"House Committee on Ways and Means","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34","ResponseDate":"2024-07-31T20:28:49.933"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4962/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Text of an amendment, recommended by the committee on Ways and Means, to the Senate Bill authorizing the city of New Bedford to grant a utility easement to the University of Massachusetts at Dartmouth (Senate, No. 2894). July 31, 2024.","DocumentText":null,"EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to authorize forthwith the granting of a utility easement by the city of New Bedford to the commonwealth, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[],"Amendments":[]}